<title>FRANCE: EU sets special maize refund for E. Europe states.</title>
<headline>EU sets special maize refund for E. Europe states.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union has set a special refund of 20 Ecus per tonne for the export of 70,000 tonnes of EU maize to four Eastern European states, EU grain officials said.</p>
<p>The four states are Slovenia, Slovakia, the Czech Republic and Poland.  </p>
<p>Last Thursday the EU had set at 15 Ecus per tonne the refund for maize exports to the same destinations.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
